# Nobody is eliminated in the first round. Then the last player loses the only
# life, giving up as well, until one player is left. s only watches and cannot
# spawn once nobody can join anymore.
maps m1:10/20
players a b c
watchers s
round c 30 | a 31 | b 32
round b 30 | a 31 | c dnf 1
round a 30 | b 31
